  m_Text: "G\xFC\xE7 sisteminin anahtarlama ve koruma merkezi.\n\n\u2022 Kesiciler
    ve ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131r\n\u2022 Bara sistemleri
    ile ba\u011Flant\u0131l\u0131d\u0131r\n\u2022 \xC7ift bara veya tek bara d\xFCzeni\n\u2022
    Ar\u0131za ak\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 keserek sistemi korur\n\u2022 Uzaktan ve
    manuel kontrol imk\xE2n\u0131"
