  m_Text: "\u015Eebeke ar\u0131zalar\u0131nda devre a\xE7an anahtarlama cihaz\u0131.\n\n\u2022
    SF6 gazl\u0131 veya vakumlu tip\n\u2022 K\u0131sa devre ak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131
